TIMING-47#1 Warning
False path, asynchronous clock group or max delay datapath only constraint between synchronous clocks  
A Clock Group timing constraint is set between synchronous clocks sys_clk and clk125_p (see constraint position 5 in the Timing Constraint window in Vivado IDE). Masking entire synchronous clock domains via  set_false_path, set_clock_groups or set_max_delay -datapath_only may result in failure in hardware.
Related violations: <none>

CLKC-55#1 Advisory
MMCME3 with global clock driver has no LOC  
The MMCME3_ADV cell MMCME2_ADV CLKIN1 or CLKIN2 pin is driven by global Clock buffer(s) IBUFDS_n_0_BUFG_inst and does not have a LOC constraint. It is recommended to LOC the MMCM and use the CLOCK_DEDICATED_ROUTE constraint on the net(s) driven by the global Clock buffer(s).
Related violations: <none>


